## XLivelessAddon (original)

The launcher/SecuROM bypass, the save/settings path redirects, the WM_ROM
message window, the borderless window handling and the INI layout descend from
[XLivelessAddon](https://github.com/GTAmodding/XLivelessAddon) by the GTAmodding
community, released into the public domain. Every file that carries adapted
code says so in its header.

## ZolikaPatch

The recovered signature tables and the SkipLauncher stage split (main, DFA,
ROM) are a reimplementation of the machine-level behaviour of ZolikaPatch 7.65
by Zolika1351. ZolikaPatch shipped as a compiled ASI without source; no
original source is redistributed here. The recovered strings, offsets and
stored bytes are data, not code.

## GTAIV.EFLC.FusionFix

The borderless-window/focus-loss logic (`source/windowed.ixx`), the
SHGetFolderPath user-data redirect (`source/userdata.ixx`) and the
`Event<Args...>` tiers, `Log`, `Game` install context and path helpers
(`source/common.ixx`) follow GTAIV.EFLC.FusionFix (`windowed.ixx`,
`userdata.ixx`, `common.ixx`), Copyright (C) ThirteenAG and contributors,
GPL-3.0. The per-feature FusionFix gating in `source/config.ixx` follows the
same project's compatibility approach.

